{"page":245,"verses":[{"verse_key":"12:79","surah":12,"ayah":79,"ar_uthmani":"قَالَ مَعَاذَ ٱللَّهِ أَن نَّأْخُذَ إِلَّا مَن وَجَدْنَا مَتَـٰعَنَا عِندَهُۥٓ إِنَّآ إِذًا لَّظَـٰلِمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He replied, ‘God forbid that we should take anyone other than the person on whom we found our property: that would be unjust of us.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"He said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"12:79"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَعَاذَ","en_gloss":"Allah forbid","transliteration":"maʿādha","verse_key":"12:79"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah forbid","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"12:79"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"12:79"},{"pos":5,"ar":"نَّأْخُذَ","en_gloss":"we take","transliteration":"nakhudha","verse_key":"12:79"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"12:79"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"(one) who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"12:79"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَجَدْنَا","en_gloss":"we found","transliteration":"wajadnā","verse_key":"12:79"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَتَـٰعَنَا","en_gloss":"our possession","transliteration":"matāʿanā","verse_key":"12:79"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عِندَهُۥٓ","en_gloss":"with him","transliteration":"ʿindahu","verse_key":"12:79"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِنَّآ","en_gloss":"Indeed, we","transliteration":"innā","verse_key":"12:79"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِذًۭا","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"idhan","verse_key":"12:79"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لَّظَـٰلِمُونَ","en_gloss":"surely (would be) wrongdoers","transliteration":"laẓālimūna","verse_key":"12:79"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٧٩","en_gloss":"(79)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"12:79"}]},{"verse_key":"12:80","surah":12,"ayah":80,"ar_uthmani":"فَلَمَّا ٱسْتَيْـَٔسُوا۟ مِنْهُ خَلَصُوا۟ نَجِيًّا ۖ قَالَ كَبِيرُهُمْ أَلَمْ تَعْلَمُوٓا۟ أَنَّ أَبَاكُمْ قَدْ أَخَذَ عَلَيْكُم مَّوْثِقًا مِّنَ ٱللَّهِ وَمِن قَبْلُ مَا فَرَّطتُمْ فِى يُوسُفَ ۖ فَلَنْ أَبْرَحَ ٱلْأَرْضَ حَتَّىٰ يَأْذَنَ لِىٓ أَبِىٓ